<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Painewebber starts Dial.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Painewebber starts Dial.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said on Monday it had started Dial Corp coverage with an &quot;attractive&quot; rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 to 14.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
